I left a `view === "map" || true` in there, which is always true and defeats the point. The map needs to re-measure when the mobile view switches to it, so I'll pass `view` through properly. I'll also fix the header so the form's height doesn't break the sticky offset by making the map's sticky `top` modest. Final version of the file:

